<title>USA: State of Ohio, won by Key Capital.</title>
<headline>State of Ohio, won by Key Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Key Capital said Tuesday it won $50 million State of Ohio highway capital improvements bonds, Series B, with a net interest cost of 4.905 percent.</p>
</text>
